### AI Job Search Assistant — REST Client requests
### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).
### Run the server first: npm run start:dev (defaults to http://localhost:3000)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000


### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### Create a resume
# @name createResume
POST {{baseUrl}}/resumes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe — Backend Engineer",
  "content": "Jane Doe — Backend Engineer\nExperience\n- Built an internal HR tool in Node.js that automated onboarding for 300 employees.\n- Designed REST APIs backed by MongoDB serving 2M requests per day.\n- Mentored two junior developers."
}

###
@resumeId = {{createResume.response.body.$._id}}


### List all resumes
GET {{baseUrl}}/resumes


### Get a single resume
GET {{baseUrl}}/resumes/{{resumeId}}


### Analyze a job posting against the resume (also creates an application)
# @name analyzeJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeId": "{{resumeId}}",
  "jobPosting": "Acme Corp is hiring a Senior Backend Engineer (NestJS).\nRequirements: 5+ years TypeScript/Node.js, NestJS, MongoDB, AWS, experience building internal tools.\nNice to have: LLM / AI product experience."
}

###
@applicationId = {{analyzeJob.response.body.$._id}}


### List all applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications


### List applications filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications?status=saved


### Get a single application
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{applicationId}}


### Update an application (status and/or note)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{applicationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "applied",
  "note": "Submitted via the company careers page."
}


### Chat with the assistant
POST {{baseUrl}}/assistant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What's the status of my application to Acme Corp?"
}


### Delete the application
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{applicationId}}


### Delete the resume
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/resumes/{{resumeId}}
